   TOTAL                         16.9              20,280          16.9
   Saving = 19.8 GB of the 32 GB pool (99.92% of the library footprint).
   Mechanism: the loader maps one physical copy of each .so into every
   address space read-only/shared; only the writable GOT/PLT and .data
   pages are private and copy-on-write. Statically linked guests would
   need more RAM for libraries alone than the host physically has.

